        "description": "A private detective with an odd personality. Likes to smoke when she is not solving cases.\n\n~!Ten years ago, she went by her real name Kyouko Mejiro and was a member of a literature club at the school [Nico Hirata](https://anilist.co/character/175657) taught the night class of. She became [Nazuna Nanakusa](https://anilist.co/character/168774)'s first friend until her father was turned into a vampire, causing both parents to die and Kyouko to quit school and disappear.!~",
